---
import TerminalLayout from '../layouts/TerminalLayout.astro';
---
<TerminalLayout title="Terminal">
  <section class="space-y-6">
    <div class="bg-soil-800 border border-soil-700 p-6 shadow-sm rounded-none font-mono">
      <h1 class="text-2xl text-terminal-amber font-bold mb-2">&gt; BITSOIL SAGEBYTE OS</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-soil-100">Where compost meets code. We don't sell solutions. We compost confusion.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-soil-700 p-6 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-soil-700 font-bold">// 01 / THE_SYLLABUS</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-sm text-soil-100">Access the biological programming tracks. Tame the wild greens, mill the fresh grain executables, and map the peer-to-peer soil networks.</p>
        <a href="/the_syllabus" class="inline-block text-xs text-terminal-amber hover:underline font-mono">&gt; initialize_boot_sequence</a>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-soil-700 p-6 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-soil-700 font-bold">// 02 / THE_COMPOST_LORE</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-sm text-soil-100">Read the chronicles of the digitally shipwrecked exiles who disconnected from the timeline to touch the living loam.</p>
        <a href="/the_compost" class="inline-block text-xs text-terminal-amber hover:underline font-mono">&gt; read_exile_logs</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-terminal-amber/40 p-6 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-terminal-amber font-bold">// 03 / WILDROOTS — DIG DEEPER</h2>
      <p class="font-serif text-sm text-soil-100">A living library you read by digging: down through the garden, the root zone, and the Dirt Alchemists' underground laboratory. Brew your kitchen scraps into named elixirs, and ask the Soil Oracle anything — it answers from the open shelves.</p>
      <a href="/dig-deeper/" class="inline-block text-xs text-terminal-amber hover:underline font-mono">&gt; descend_into_the_library</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</TerminalLayout>
